OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F331A1786808882
OL,3,CWorld's first football club announces
OL,4,CSpice Girl as new sponsor
OL,6,FThe world's first football club has
OL,7,Fcontinued its re-brand with a Spice
OL,8,FGirl collaboration.
OL,10,FMelanie C, or 'Sporty Spice', has been
OL,11,Funveiled as the front-of-shirt sponsor
OL,12,Ffor the Sheffield FC women's team this
OL,13,Fyear.JShe described it as an "honour",
OL,14,Fsaying:
OL,1,Woz5~k4{$z%~s1z5jw=hw1         G1/3
OL,2,W,.!+.!/*%/*%,.!/*%/*%/"-$T,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BYorks News CReg TV FThis Day
FL,332,330,260,120,000,100
PN,33102
SC,0002
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F331A1786808882
OL,3,CWorld's first football club announces
OL,4,CSpice Girl as new sponsor
OL,6,F"Sheffield holds such a special place
OL,7,Fin my heart, having been such a big
OL,8,Fpart of my career over the last 30
OL,9,Fyears ` from writing and recording
OL,10,F'Say You'll Be There' with the Spice
OL,11,FGirls in the city, to our first
OL,12,Fstadium show at Don Valley, and my
OL,13,Ffirst ever solo gig at the iconic
OL,14,FLeadmill.
OL,16,F"Growing up in Liverpool, football is
OL,17,Fin my DNA, and to see the incredible
OL,18,Fgrowth of the women's game, from
OL,19,Fgrassroots to the international stage,
OL,20,Fis so exciting.
OL,1,Woz5~k4{$z%~s1z5jw=hw1         G2/3
OL,2,W,.!+.!/*%/*%,.!/*%/*%/"-$T,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BYorks News CReg TV FThis Day
FL,332,330,260,120,000,100
PN,33103
SC,0003
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F331A1786808882
OL,3,CWorld's first football club announces
OL,4,CSpice Girl as new sponsor
OL,6,F"To now have the opportunity to be
OL,7,Fpart of that journey at the oldest
OL,8,Ffootball club in the world makes me
OL,9,Fincredibly proud.
OL,11,F"I'm loving the new kit and will be
OL,12,Fwearing it with pride. I can't wait to
OL,13,Fbe cheering the team on from the
OL,14,Fsidelines!"
OL,1,Woz5~k4{$z%~s1z5jw=hw1         G3/3
OL,2,W,.!+.!/*%/*%,.!/*%/*%/"-$T,,,,,,,,,,,,,
